TASK-246 runtime harness: titled-visit search after the title matcher moved to
Span. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Apply, build, run, revert:

    git apply docs/harness/task246-harness.patch
    xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    OUT="<scratch dir>"; mkdir -p "$OUT"
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify246 DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR="$OUT" \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    # wait for the "done" line in $OUT/verify.log (about 13 s), then kill that pid
    git apply -R docs/harness/task246-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    # the run writes autosave keys suffixed -DetourVerify246 into the real
    # com.detourbrowser.mac defaults (TASK-217); delete exactly those
    defaults read com.detourbrowser.mac | grep DetourVerify246
    defaults delete com.detourbrowser.mac "NSWindow Frame BrowserWindow-DetourVerify246"   # and any other listed

Seeds three titled visits through recordVisit (an ASCII title, one that folds
to ASCII, a Cyrillic one: the matcher's three paths), logs what searchVisits
(History page) and searchURLs (chrome.history.search) return for title words,
which go through history_title_matches, then types title words into the
Cmd+T palette and logs its rows.

